<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>You've Been Phished | Maui Fishing Demo</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: #f7f7fb;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #30204f, #0d0b14 65%);
    }

    main {
      width: min(680px, 100%);
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 56px);
      border: 1px solid #55416f;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: rgba(22, 17, 34, .94);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .fish {
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #d9d0e5;
    }

    .notice {
      margin: 28px 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #261c35;
      color: #eee7f7;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    ul {
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #d9d0e5;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #17111f;
      background: #f0c36b;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      background: #ffd98c;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: #a99bb9;
      font-size: .9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="fish" aria-hidden="true">🎣</div>

    <h1>You've Been Phished</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      The Maui fishing trip was fictional. This was a harmless demonstration
      of how convincing an AI-generated offer can look.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>No information was collected.</strong><br>
      There was no login form, payment request, tracking, malware, or hidden data capture.
    </div>

    <p>
      Here are a few clues worth checking whenever an unexpected offer lands
      in your messages:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Is the offer unexpected or unusually convenient?</li>
      <li>Does the link destination match the business being advertised?</li>
      <li>Is the page using polished images and persuasive copy to create trust?</li>
      <li>Can you verify the business through a separate, trusted channel?</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="https://bikemike7.github.io/Spoke-n-Word/">
      Return to Spoke ’n Word
    </a>

    <footer>The fish was fake. The lesson is real.</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
